        "reference": "Mosiah 24:18",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 24,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And in the morning the Lord caused a deep sleep to come upon the Lamanites, yea, and all their task-masters were in a profound sleep.",
        "footNotes": [
